{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:22:07Z","created_by_operation":"op_8927260579b842f6934f37f346998dcf","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_03711d486d1699152d9c7c0c9caf5820a30a3f0bcca9ea4f7e460650be1b4408","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"nanocoai/nanoclaw@3f9ed607b7e7 snapshot 2c4c789497c747f6","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0b281b052adc8e0d11fe5afba570cb30234aca3e8ba53fbf71e93b92b77c3f24","slc_db4440cc9ca32253e48fab513c917afe21f828331353242025763f77bcbb1d54"],"source_ids":["src_871248f08f6b5106ac2bd85028dd5d76"],"text":"Agents never hold raw API keys; outbound requests route through OneCLI's Agent Vault, which injects credentials at request time and enforces per-agent policies and rate limits.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:22:07Z","updated_by_operation":"op_8927260579b842f6934f37f346998dcf"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:22:07Z","created_by_operation":"op_8927260579b842f6934f37f346998dcf","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_0a9999bbecfbc32b5ad876ad92b8f80df1c1c23a3cb02262cdde6bcfe8d6b913","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"nanocoai/nanoclaw@3f9ed607b7e7 snapshot 2c4c789497c747f6","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_81d3fbb9bd1de7c3ee3fad16072e3650a64111317eec6c680e26c3a4961c067b","slc_c9690fff271f495297bcc8d40b2700adecc3b0243744dc1a0ac58fe923ce99c1"],"source_ids":["src_ba8e0574e1e75221a711e63385babdb3"],"text":"Channel adapters return platform channel and thread IDs without knowing agent-group or session IDs; the host maps those to the entity model, and session mode (shared vs per-thread) is configured per channel.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:22:07Z","updated_by_operation":"op_8927260579b842f6934f37f346998dcf"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:22:07Z","created_by_operation":"op_8927260579b842f6934f37f346998dcf","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_0c69316f38b290f83bf63f84a1148423f8cd56b9cc4947362696e3ad1dac316c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"nanocoai/nanoclaw@3f9ed607b7e7 snapshot 2c4c789497c747f6","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_9beea51498e6a5b40cd2f2e2ecdbdb600dab4877e5bc477dae9527d8a8e4cec1","slc_bb2ec9a7c5c57bae9268756355f1349f7515e6481b5101b02a4a1a1acf586d1f"],"source_ids":["src_871248f08f6b5106ac2bd85028dd5d76"],"text":"Requirements are macOS or Linux (Windows via WSL2), Node.js 22+, pnpm 10+, Docker, and Claude Code for /customize, /debug, setup error recovery, and /add-<channel> skills; the installer installs Node and pnpm if missing.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:22:07Z","updated_by_operation":"op_8927260579b842f6934f37f346998dcf"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:22:07Z","created_by_operation":"op_8927260579b842f6934f37f346998dcf","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_28579e58674e33a6e8f89efc1cc0252bfa4cfd45fdc96b1a136e1d1e17113835","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"nanocoai/nanoclaw@3f9ed607b7e7 snapshot 2c4c789497c747f6","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4f4cef9a13c3225df75d43b667ce96701e3b3ec72503ee701323981b9847552b","slc_6c865a3caabdec09e1cb350ea025fe2871acaf6abfe1a6571b4fd238984ce681","slc_71c85c172cd10fdcf6278d812bb43e199ca6cca67553ca2658144ce461865f8a"],"source_ids":["src_871248f08f6b5106ac2bd85028dd5d76"],"text":"The project deliberately avoids configuration files; customization is done by asking Claude Code to modify the small codebase, or via a guided /customize command.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:22:07Z","updated_by_operation":"op_8927260579b842f6934f37f346998dcf"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:22:07Z","created_by_operation":"op_8927260579b842f6934f37f346998dcf","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_7fe1e3da4664ce173ee2ee745448164f9e13daaf3af7559af2ed9735b99e7484","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=skills-patterns","setting":"nanocoai/nanoclaw@3f9ed607b7e7 snapshot 2c4c789497c747f6","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_8ba804341742d14df7206f8aa86209756a7c07d240e77cf2c974de507e42b66f","slc_999758a0b349d5bd1ed370ae3dedfb8bd68fab460ab961aecdba360f8ff16109"],"source_ids":["src_871248f08f6b5106ac2bd85028dd5d76"],"text":"Trunk ships only the registry and infrastructure; channel adapters and alternative providers live on long-lived channels/providers branches and are installed into a user's fork via /add-<name> skills that copy modules, wire registration, and pin dependencies.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:22:07Z","updated_by_operation":"op_8927260579b842f6934f37f346998dcf"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:22:07Z","created_by_operation":"op_8927260579b842f6934f37f346998dcf","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_835405c6e6d8fa3adf1c998bdc9deffa9583ea1094a2bc657f7500bc30cf8bb4","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"nanocoai/nanoclaw@3f9ed607b7e7 snapshot 2c4c789497c747f6","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_223958235a101f3d784c22b82a9b0c29cae3bd1721f9dc33e53f5c63382cd047","slc_e1ef3015efa3c75447101963c6c67a0e279cee9446949054b741aa43e7bd74cb"],"source_ids":["src_ba8e0574e1e75221a711e63385babdb3"],"text":"The host acts as orchestrator: it spawns containers on wakeUpAgent when none exists, kills idle containers after a timeout, and runs a ~60s sweep for stale detection, due-message wake, delivery, and recurrence insertion.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:22:07Z","updated_by_operation":"op_8927260579b842f6934f37f346998dcf"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:22:07Z","created_by_operation":"op_8927260579b842f6934f37f346998dcf","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a2cfc3d5e8b5fad6be3ea1ade00ae9e126b3ff59a102c5e335d9b7bb92917470","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"nanocoai/nanoclaw@3f9ed607b7e7 snapshot 2c4c789497c747f6","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_50e61219c429f01d31eca8043026e88e5f71a9227378c4c3a03c2f6fa13e809b","slc_d3cd63c74c61e146b82a489436488aa6e7525de9dc10c7b5d89e4e0185fbca98"],"source_ids":["src_ba8e0574e1e75221a711e63385babdb3"],"text":"Each session has a pair of mounted SQLite files as the only host-container IO mechanism: inbound.db (host-written, container read-only) and outbound.db (container-written), each with exactly one writer and journal_mode=DELETE rather than WAL.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:22:07Z","updated_by_operation":"op_8927260579b842f6934f37f346998dcf"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:22:07Z","created_by_operation":"op_8927260579b842f6934f37f346998dcf","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_ac85fef8ab0b3c532266b493b6cbacd14a03c5af010738ce47bc22edfb44fd33","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"nanocoai/nanoclaw@3f9ed607b7e7 snapshot 2c4c789497c747f6","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_faefb2614496446e0474b3eacc4d8ca1282e86e85d9085919cd2c20cd9219fde"],"source_ids":["src_ba8e0574e1e75221a711e63385babdb3"],"text":"Message sequence numbers use disjoint parity — even seqs written by the host in messages_in, odd by the container in messages_out — forming a single monotonic id across both tables.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:22:07Z","updated_by_operation":"op_8927260579b842f6934f37f346998dcf"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:22:07Z","created_by_operation":"op_8927260579b842f6934f37f346998dcf","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b0512fa8f2a4e24a724468625dae4e1396e9841d5f0c833e633d2e64e78ee19b","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"nanocoai/nanoclaw@3f9ed607b7e7 snapshot 2c4c789497c747f6","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_690d5286df74cd4e2ac771f3e1f7ceda87af7ef1255fd47560e6b0015e6d35c8","slc_c84ec2fcc5dbb59a47f31cedc3c7b50c93c09e674887c9ebadf67f016fccd5dd"],"source_ids":["src_871248f08f6b5106ac2bd85028dd5d76","src_ba8e0574e1e75221a711e63385babdb3"],"text":"A single Node host process routes messages through an entity model (user → messaging group → agent group → session), writes to the session's inbound.db, and wakes the container; the agent-runner inside polls inbound.db and writes responses to outbound.db.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:22:07Z","updated_by_operation":"op_8927260579b842f6934f37f346998dcf"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:22:07Z","created_by_operation":"op_8927260579b842f6934f37f346998dcf","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c3b585fce0a4bdfafe1446200faa88091e102ee59c7b5329d22b494bb9ea2f39","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"nanocoai/nanoclaw@3f9ed607b7e7 snapshot 2c4c789497c747f6","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_a2bf6aa80943c09e7aff32528f1629ecd24343ea9bba3b69d251fba0194f53f5","slc_d8e43a4619390171aa5ba32bf5f4d5e7eff56530d1755fee1d97cc851d8aac44"],"source_ids":["src_871248f08f6b5106ac2bd85028dd5d76"],"text":"Repository development practice: contributions to the base are limited to security fixes, bug fixes, and clear improvements; new capabilities must be contributed as skills on the channels/providers branches or as self-contained skills, per CONTRIBUTING.md.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:22:07Z","updated_by_operation":"op_8927260579b842f6934f37f346998dcf"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:22:07Z","created_by_operation":"op_8927260579b842f6934f37f346998dcf","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_ca771bd2d75b19d4e5bd756e879dc1671c48ed1ebbffa94ae91b3d99a80670b1","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"nanocoai/nanoclaw@3f9ed607b7e7 snapshot 2c4c789497c747f6","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_192c702d5135c3d438e23ab50245f18a674449b733fff3b25d5c3c0c847a179f","slc_af857659860c94076ad028e894e43768b03e4aa2073af6667e68ed450701f0f7","slc_f1f847a62c895cc6def46203158857503f69991c40d172d268f4f4e8e598b65c"],"source_ids":["src_ba8e0574e1e75221a711e63385babdb3"],"text":"Outbound file delivery is tool-based: the agent calls a dedicated send_file MCP tool, the runner stages files in an outbox directory per messages_out row, messages_out references filenames only, and the host delivers and cleans up after delivery.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:22:07Z","updated_by_operation":"op_8927260579b842f6934f37f346998dcf"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:22:07Z","created_by_operation":"op_8927260579b842f6934f37f346998dcf","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_d2866fc2a317926ad5a529b800892795ec60cba25fe09f6ac154b8290e0332ca","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"nanocoai/nanoclaw@3f9ed607b7e7 snapshot 2c4c789497c747f6","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0b281b052adc8e0d11fe5afba570cb30234aca3e8ba53fbf71e93b92b77c3f24","slc_751447dd9093dc2dd4b9d170960d5a3b7b73d54c6d4cae30bf105af1d5578eff","slc_d133618dcec4a76b0f54b9349d7a26fd20a7e27e11136ea2cfc49f8f5843bf5d","slc_db4440cc9ca32253e48fab513c917afe21f828331353242025763f77bcbb1d54"],"source_ids":["src_871248f08f6b5106ac2bd85028dd5d76"],"text":"Agents run in their own Linux/Docker containers with filesystem isolation, so bash commands execute inside the container rather than on the host, and only explicitly mounted directories are visible.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:22:07Z","updated_by_operation":"op_8927260579b842f6934f37f346998dcf"}
